+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:003",
+      "heading": "Lesson 03 — Pattern Interrupt Hook",
+      "content": "Lesson 03 — Pattern Interrupt Hook\nLesson ka hook: Presenter pehle second mein kaagaz phaad deti hai: \"Ye tha tumhara\npurana content plan. Ab naya plan banate hain.\"\nKya hai: Kuch aisa jo feed mein baaki sab se alag dikhe ya sunaayi de.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Feed mein sab ek jaisa chalta hai. Achaanak kuch alag hua, toh\naankh khud ruk jaati hai.\nFormula: Pehle hi second mein kuch unexpected karo — kuch phaad do, kuch gira do,\nachaanak zoom, ya ek tez sound.\nExamples\n•Cooking reel ko anda phodne ki awaaz se shuru karo.\n•Fashion reel mein pehle second pe dupatta hawa mein uchhaalo.\nGalti / rule\nSirf drama nahi — interrupt ka reel ke topic se connection hona chahiye, warna log cheat feel\nkarenge.\nAaj ka kaam\nApni agli reel ka ek unexpected pehla second plan karo.",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 3,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_3",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 03 — Pattern Interrupt Hook",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "6d43b4ab86553126dcb1b9d9195d1b07dca5713a8ead70688d7bf8fa146c0568",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:004",
+      "heading": "Lesson 04 — Bold Statement (Contrarian) Hook",
+      "content": "Lesson 04 — Bold Statement (Contrarian) Hook\nLesson ka hook: \"Daily post karna band karo.\" Phir: \"Haan, sahi suna. Quality wali 3 reels,\nbekaar wali 7 se better hain.\"\nKya hai: Woh bolo jo common advice ke bilkul ulta ho.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Koi ulta bolta hai, toh dimaag turant poochhta hai — \"arre, kyun?\" —\naur wahin ruk jaata hai.\nFormula: Pehle bolo ki log jo kaam karte hain woh band karo, aur phir turant uski ek solid\nwajah do.\nExamples\n•Study page: \"Highlighter use karna band karo.\"\n•Finance page: \"Saving se pehle ye ek kaam karo.\"\nGalti / rule\nBold ka matlab jhooth nahi — jo bolo use reel mein explain karo, aur reason sachcha hona\nchahiye.\nAaj ka kaam\nApne niche ki ek common advice pakdo aur uska ulta hook likho.",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 4,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_4",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 04 — Bold Statement (Contrarian) Hook",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "354c074214772edb25c4a8dd5e37cc5033c4ee72ba312d1ef323c8895d095c7b",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:005",
+      "heading": "Lesson 05 — Question Hook",
+      "content": "Lesson 05 — Question Hook\nLesson ka hook: \"Tumhari reel log 2 second mein skip kyun kar dete hain? Kyunki pehla\nsawaal hi boring tha.\"\nKya hai: Viewer se seedha woh sawaal poochho jo uske dimaag mein pehle se ghoom raha\nhai.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Sawaal sunte hi dimaag jawaab dhoondhne lagta hai — aur banda\nautomatically engage ho jaata hai.\nFormula: Viewer se uski apni problem wala sawaal poochho, jaise \"Kya tumhe bhi ye hota\nhai?\" — aur sawaal ekdum specific rakho.\nExamples\n•Skincare: \"Kya tumhara face bhi dopahar tak oily ho jaata hai?\"\n•Gaming: \"Aim last moment pe kyun hilti hai?\"\nGalti / rule\n\"Hello guys, kaise ho?\" se shuru karna — ye sawaal nahi, scroll karne ka invitation hai.\nAaj ka kaam\nApni audience ki 3 problems likho, aur har ek ko sawaal wala hook banao.",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 5,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_5",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 05 — Question Hook",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "b84bcc28b616b2a968abd0a5413c6fc0779ed36911ca03b5e75394b31da73908",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:006",
+      "heading": "Lesson 06 — Story Hook (beech se shuru)",
+      "content": "Lesson 06 — Story Hook (beech se shuru)\nLesson ka hook: \"Kal raat 2 baje mere phone pe ek message aaya... aur uske baad maine\napna poora content style badal diya.\"\n\nKya hai: Kahani shuru se nahi, sabse interesting moment se shuru karo.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Kahani mein dimaag khud ko daal deta hai. Aur kahani beech mein\nho, toh end jaanna zaroori lagta hai.\nFormula: Pehle time ya jagah batao (\"kal raat\", \"aaj office mein\"), aur phir seedha twist wala\nmoment.\nExamples\n•Travel: \"Manali pahunchte hi cab wale ne mana kar diya...\"\n•Business: \"Pehle customer ne hi order cancel kar diya...\"\nGalti / rule\nKahani background ya bachpan se shuru karna. Pehle action, background baad mein.\nAaj ka kaam\nApni life ka ek moment lo, aur use beech se shuru karke hook likho.",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 6,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_6",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 06 — Story Hook (beech se shuru)",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "85300322657cc2ca843dd8c1be51cb7d05977a24897ee532190980efa46b529f",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:007",
+      "heading": "Lesson 07 — Visual Hook",
+      "content": "Lesson 07 — Visual Hook\nLesson ka hook: Presenter ek laal apple seedha camera ki taraf laati hai: \"Pehle aankh ruki,\nphir kaan khule — hai na?\"\nKya hai: Pehla frame itna alag ho ki bina sound ke bhi rukna pade.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Bahut log reels mute pe scroll karte hain. Isliye pehla frame hi asli\nhook hai.\nFormula: Reel ko extreme close-up, tez movement ya kisi ajeeb angle se shuru karo, taaki\npehla frame hi alag dikhe.\nExamples\n•Food reel ko uthti bhaap ke close-up se shuru karo.\n•Product reel mein item ko seedha camera ki taraf laao.\nGalti / rule\nShuru ke 2 second blank intro ya logo animation — wahi sabse fast skip hota hai.\nAaj ka kaam\nApni agli reel ka pehla frame mute karke dekho — kya woh akele rokta hai?",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 7,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_7",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 07 — Visual Hook",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "a891501b6cadb206b892a3323efc8663d0ea365dbc63426ad92cbf1cc304b815",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:008",
+      "heading": "Lesson 08 — List (Number) Hook",
+      "content": "Lesson 08 — List (Number) Hook\nLesson ka hook: \"3 hooks jo sabse zyada kaam karte hain... question, story aur list. Aur aaj\nseekhenge list wala.\"\nKya hai: Number sunte hi bande ko pata chal jaata hai ki kitna value milega.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Number dimaag ko clear promise deta hai — chhoti list, fast value,\naur end tak rukne ki wajah.\nFormula: Shuru mein number bolo, jaise \"3 galtiyaan jo sab karte hain\", aur batao ki aakhri\nwali sabse important hai, taaki log end tak rukein.\n\nExamples\n•Budget page: \"3 apps jo mere kharche track karte hain.\"\n•Coding: \"5 shortcuts jo har beginner ko pata hone chahiye.\"\nGalti / rule\nList mein 10 points thoonsna. 3 se 5 rakho — reel chhoti aur punchy rehti hai.\nAaj ka kaam\nEk list wali reel plan karo, aur sabse strong point aakhir mein rakho.",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 8,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_8",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 08 — List (Number) Hook",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "f6396dcec4b1f3d1a6cf0037f536a53a36b2c97ab30eebd6d9c13c6acd684e21",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:009",
+      "heading": "Lesson 09 — POV (Relatable) Hook",
+      "content": "Lesson 09 — POV (Relatable) Hook\nLesson ka hook: \"POV: tumne 4 ghante edit kiya, aur reel pe aaye 200 views.\" Phir:\n\"Relatable laga na?\"\nKya hai: Viewer ki apni roz ki situation act karo, taaki woh soche — \"arre, ye toh main hoon!\"\nKyun kaam karta hai: Jab banda khud ko reel mein dekhta hai, toh woh rukta bhi hai aur\ndoston ko send bhi karta hai.\nFormula: \"POV\" likho, aur phir ek specific roz wali situation dikhao jo tumhari audience sach\nmein face karti hai.\nExamples\n•Student: \"POV: exam se pehli raat syllabus pehli baar khola.\"\n•Office: \"POV: Friday 6 baje boss ka call.\"\nGalti / rule\nSituation general rakhna. Jitni specific hogi, utni relatable lagegi.\nAaj ka kaam\nApni audience ke 5 roz wale moments likho, aur har ek ko POV hook banao.",
+      "contentType": "lesson-summary",
+      "lessonNumber": 9,
+      "lessonId": "lesson_9",
+      "lessonName": "Lesson 09 — POV (Relatable) Hook",
+      "sourceDocument": "course-notes.txt",
+      "sourceHash": "185dd08e9df2ddccc113508d7ca0dc5caaea19912756e8e4ed2a07c1cad27530",
+      "contentHash": "fbf139cf6ee059cb0d2263aeedc3abc891e9ccba5e575a83b9330d20cc0d30b5",
+      "aliases": []
+    },
+    {
+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:lesson-summary:010",
+      "heading": "Lesson 10 — Finale: Apna Hook Formula",
+      "content": "Lesson 10 — Finale: Apna Hook Formula\nLesson ka hook: \"Ye woh aakhri cheez hai jo tumhe hooks ke baare mein jaanni hai... par\nsirf tab, jab tum end tak ruko.\" (Curiosity + bold ek saath.)\nKya hai: Recap: curiosity, pattern interrupt, bold statement, question, story, visual, list aur\nPOV — 8 hooks.\nKyun kaam karta hai: Best hooks aksar do types mila ke bante hain — jaise question +\nvisual, ya story + curiosity.\nFormula: chat G.P.T se hooks likhwao: apna niche, audience aur hook type batao, aur bolo\n\"10 options do\". Phir ek hi topic ke 2 hooks banao, dono try karo, aur dekho kis mein log\nzyada ruke.\nGalti / rule\nGolden rule: hook ek promise hai. Reel mein woh promise poora karo, warna trust chala\njaayega.\n\nAaj ka kaam\nFinal project: apne niche ke liye har type ka ek hook likho, aur unse 8 reels shoot karo.",
