+      "heading": "FAQ / troubleshooting",
+      "content": "User ka sawaal / problem                Jawab\n\n Mere views kam hain, kya hook ki        Ho sakta hai. Pehle 3 second check karo: line specific hai? mute pe\n wajah se?                               pehla frame rokta hai? blank intro toh nahi? (L01, L07)\n\n Kaunsa hook sabse best hai?             Koi ek best nahi — topic pe depend karta hai. Part D ki table se type\n                                         chuno, aur 2 hooks A/B test karo. (L10)\n\n Mera hook clickbait lagta hai           Check karo reel mein payoff hai ya nahi. Promise wahi karo jo deliver\n                                         kar sako. (L01, L10)\n\n Log ruk ke bhi beech mein chale         Hook ka payoff jaldi aur saaf do; list hook mein strong point aakhir\n jaate hain                              mein rakho. (L02, L08)\n\n Mera niche boring hai, hook kaise       Question hook (audience ki problem) ya POV hook (roz ki situation) se\n banau?                                  shuru karo. (L05, L09)\n\n Bina bole hook kaise?                   Visual hook — close-up, tez movement, ajeeb angle, ya pehle frame\n                                         pe bada text. (L07)\n\n Hello guys se shuru kar sakta hoon?     Nahi — seedha hook se shuru karo, intro baad mein ya bilkul nahi.\n                                         (L05)\n\n Story bahut lambi ho jaati hai          Kahani beech se shuru karo — time/jagah + twist. Background baad\n                                         mein. (L06)\n\n chat G.P.T ke hooks generic aate        Niche, audience, topic aur hook type saaf likho, aur \"10 options\"\n hain                                    maango (Part F). (L10)\n\n Kitne points ki list?                   3 se 5. Zyada points se reel lambi aur slow ho jaati hai. (L08)\n\n Kya viral hone ki guarantee hai?        Nahi — hook rukne ke chances badhata hai, guarantee koi nahi deta.",
