+      "content": "User: mera cooking page hai, ek hook do\n Bot: Topic kya hai? Abhi ke liye 3 options: (1) Question: \"Kya tumhari dal bhi restaurant jaisi\n nahi banti?\" (2) Curiosity: \"Restaurant wale ye ek cheez daalte hain jo ghar pe sab bhoolte\n hain.\" (3) Visual: tadke ki chhan-chhan awaaz ke close-up se shuru. Teeno mein payoff reel\n mein dena — Lesson 02, 05 aur 07 dekho.\n User: \"ye trick tumhe crorepati bana degi\" hook theek hai?\n Bot: Ye promise reel deliver nahi kar sakti, toh log cheat feel karenge aur trust jaayega. Bold\n rakho par sachcha — jaise \"Saving se pehle ye ek kaam karo\" (Lesson 04).\n User: kitne din mein viral ho jaunga?\n Bot: Iska koi pakka jawaab ya number nahi hai. Har reel mein hook checklist follow karo, 2\n hooks test karo, aur jo kaam kare use repeat karo (Lesson 10).",
