+      "chunkId": "viral-hook-formula:workflow:016",
+      "heading": "Eight hook categories — formulas and use cases",
+      "content": "Hook type           Formula (ek line)                                  Kab use karo\n\n Curiosity gap       Ek secret ka promise, jawaab end mein              Tips, secrets, behind-the-scenes\n\n Pattern interrupt   Pehle second mein kuch unexpected                  Jab feed mein content ek jaisa ho\n                     (action/sound/zoom)\n\n Bold statement      Common advice ka ulta + solid wajah                Opinion, myth-busting\n\n Question            Audience ki apni problem ka specific sawaal        Problem-solution content\n\n Story               Time/jagah + seedha twist wala moment              Experiences, case studies\n\n Visual              Close-up, tez movement ya ajeeb angle se           Food, product, travel, fashion\n                     shuru\n\n List                Number + aakhri point sabse strong                 Tips, tools, mistakes\n\n POV                 \"POV:\" + specific roz wali situation               Relatable, comedy, student/office life\n\n\n\n",
